.TH "libnvme" 9 "enum nvme_aer_one_shot" "October 2026" "API Manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
enum nvme_aer_one_shot \- Asynchronous Event Information - One Shot
.SH SYNOPSIS
enum nvme_aer_one_shot {
.br
.BI "    NVME_AER_ONE_SHOT_VOLTAGE_THRESHOLD_EVENT"

};
.SH Constants
.IP "NVME_AER_ONE_SHOT_VOLTAGE_THRESHOLD_EVENT" 12
Voltage Threshold Event: the
interval voltage measurement crossed one of the voltage thresholds
configured by the Voltage Threshold feature, see \fIenum
nvme_aer_voltage_threshold_event\fP for the Event Specific Parameter
field format.
